<section>
  <h2>About this service</h2>
  <p>Stuck on a bug? Put a rubber duck next to your keyboard and explain the code to it, line by
  line. Somewhere around line twelve you will hear yourself say the wrong thing, and the fix is
  suddenly obvious. The duck did nothing. That is the point.</p>
  <p>Our ducks are trained professionals. They never interrupt, never judge and stay calm even
  when the build is in hot water. Whatever you tell the duck stays with the duck.</p>
</section>

